    "enUS": {
      "description": "You find a Dusty Unsent Letter in the old footlocker.",
      "dialogue": {
        "44e7835b96d070d871c9": "Interesting.  So the chap did spend some time in Moonbrook after all.  It is rather odd the letter never got delivered.  Nonetheless, I shall update the registry.",
        "97763728436bbf957a19": "Ah, I remember you.  You're the one who was asking about that Stalvan fellow.  Did you ever find what you were looking for?"
      },
      "summary": "Take the Dusty Unsent Letter to Clerk Daltry.",
      "title": "The Legend of Stalvan",
